zsnes2 (2.3.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.3.4.
  * Enable upstream-supported amd64, i386, arm64 and riscv64 builds.
  * Remove the obsolete NASM build dependency after upstream completed
    the C11 port.
  * Update installation paths and architecture-aware autopkgtests for
    the new upstream tree.
  * Match upstream PIE policy: keep x86 builds non-PIE while retaining
    PIE on arm64 and riscv64.
  * Add amd64 multilib build dependencies for upstream's 32-bit x86 tests.

 -- Reaper <JohnGrimmReaper@disroot.org>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 21:10:17 +0000

zsnes2 (2.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian release.
  * Package ZSNES 2 as a separate zsnes2 source and binary package so it can
    coexist with the historical zsnes package.
  * Build the upstream 2.2.3 release as the supported 32-bit x86 Linux target
    with SDL3 and OpenGL support.

 -- Reaper <JohnGrimmReaper@disroot.org>  Thu, 03 Sep 2026 16:53:00 +0000
